# Bazzite Kid Mode

This repository contains a simple parent-managed launcher and monitor for a Bazzite/KDE child account. It is designed to enforce a safe app and browsing environment without requiring admin credentials from the child.

It is intentionally designed to be limited to legitimate child-safe desktop controls:
- allow only approved apps
- block known gaming and chat clients during restricted hours
- enforce time limits
- keep the browser on a safe default page

